{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_16_level_main_16-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_16",
  "stageId": "main_16-08",
  "title": "疯人的辩护",
  "storyCode": "16-9",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b7c026397f38b74ebe455ed459b3506f3f7755ef618cea3cf9bfa3c6924d02ce",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "66_g14_ursusvillage"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "乌萨斯的深秋，夜晚的气温骤降。寒风席卷，吹得枝桠上的积雪纷纷飘落。\n空地上，人群早已散去，远处错落的矮屋也看不到一户亮灯。\n空地中央的火堆里，烧焦的木柴上依然残存着一丝火焰，火苗被北风一遍遍撕扯，延续着最后的喘息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一根粗壮的木柴被扔进了火堆中，扬起的火星在空中飘散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了我们的行踪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "干燥的木柴躺在焦炭中，渐渐被熏黑，变形，随后被突然蹿起的火焰完全淹没。\n火光映照在虚弱的感染者的面庞上，可他却感受不到一丝温暖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些人。这里的......所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有把他们也抹去......就像抹去加尼亚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们才不必......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必丧失道德，不必背弃纯洁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必玷污灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他很疼，钻心地疼，像被针尖穿透。\n他很冷，冷得不住颤抖，像掉入冰冻的湖泊。\n他必须让自己暖和起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一根，两根，三根。\n一捆，两捆，三捆。\n原本微弱的火苗从木头的缝隙中钻出，变成一只炽热的魔鬼，它的火舌几乎要刺到点火者的身体。\n瘦弱的矿工拾起一根燃烧的木棍，向寂静的房屋走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_newiceforest_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "噔，哒。噔，哒。\n有节奏的脚步声，一轻一重，一强一弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睡着......睡着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全都睡着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们不知道自己会面临怎样的困境，会面对怎样的审判。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帮助和包藏感染者，然后将他们出卖。无知的人，温驯如驮兽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会帮助你们，我能帮助你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......因为我愿意默想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "并分担......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们的痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "狂徒手握恐惧的火把，但零星的火焰已经不能抑制他的寒冷。\n他感到冰冷刺骨。寒气来自矿石病，来自寒风，来自乌萨斯。\n他需要更多的温暖。\n突然间，一大堆干草出现在他的视野中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一场火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他抛下火把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一场净化——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火舌唤醒了所有枯萎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一次拯救！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他从未如此清晰地感觉到，自己活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g10_tent_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "脑内持续地嗡鸣，雷尔金努力想从噩梦中抢夺回一丝感知与理智。\n五感正在一点点恢复，可哀嚎声仍没有远去，反而越来越近。\n他强撑着身体，蹒跚着朝帐篷外走去，想要呼吸一口新鲜的空气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutry_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "灼热的空气扑面而来，身上的冷汗几乎立刻便被蒸发。\n一瞬间，所有的感觉全部回到了体内，刺激着雷尔金的身体。\n这里不是梦境，这里是现实。噩梦中的场景在现实中被延续。\n四处都是逃窜的人群，那些曾给人们提供庇护的房屋，现在正被火焰摧枯拉朽地吞没。\n升腾的浓烟里，那些焦苦绝望的气息如同魔爪死死扼住每个人的喉咙，人在这威压之下，渺小如蚁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1967_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷尔金！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里......发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1967_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道，火是突然间蹿起来的。这个火势我们根本没法扑灭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1967_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们现在能做的只有疏散大家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激动的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷尔金，我们换来的粮食都还在里面，我得进去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪里还有功夫管这种事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去把所有人叫醒！让所有人逃到村子外面去！快，快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可火场里的人群并没有因为雷尔金的话变得更有秩序，恐惧在肆无忌惮地蔓延。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他从未......\n死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutry_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，这不对......我赢了，我杀死了他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能救所有人......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老师！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别乔克，你怎么在这？快到安全的地方去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老师，我、我......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你听不懂我的话吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷尔金想甩开别乔克的手，可小女孩使尽全身力气拽住了他的手臂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，奶奶，她、她，不见了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么......？你不是一直跟她在一起吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "口吃的女孩双手并用，试图解释发生了什么，可她恐惧的表情已经说明了一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尼克托！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你继续疏散大家，我跟别乔克去找娜迦夫人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1967_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷尔金和别乔克穿梭在火场之中。两侧房屋烧燎，稍不注意，他们的衣服就会被火点燃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶......呜，呜，奶奶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷尔金也想大声呼喊，可无力感在他的心中不断累积，堵住了他的咽喉，让他难以发声，让他难以呼吸。\n他很清楚，如此猛烈的大火，对于一个行动困难的老者来说意味着什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老、老师，我......您......唔......唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "冒着黑烟的十字路口，别乔克捂住嘴指了指自己，又指了指雷尔金，最后指向了路的分岔处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不行......别乔克，你不能和我分开行动......你听我说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老师！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女孩此刻涨红着脸，豆大的泪珠从她的双眸中涌出。她将双手交握，做出一种奇异的、虔诚的祈祷模样。\n她不祈求皇帝，不祈求圣愚。她祈求雷尔金的帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutry_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一个黑影从两人的眼前闯过，他一瘸一拐，步伐却异常有力，仿佛被什么吸引了一般。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍里？你要去哪？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佝偻的背影并没有理会雷尔金的呼喊，他只是朝着路尽头的火海走去。\n四面八方的火光驱散了他的影子，他如传闻中走向刑场的圣愚一样，像是要准备迎接火焰的沐浴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别乔克，等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至此，我犯下杀戮的罪过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不为食物，不为洁净的水，不为温暖的房屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他念诵着，步履不停，推开一扇燃烧的房门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷尔金的视线越过霍里，即便火光持续灼烧着他的双眼，也无法阻止他看见房屋里的一切——\n火焰狰狞翻腾，焦黑的梁柱摇摇晃晃，噼啪声如垂死者断断续续的呻吟。\n然而，一位老妇却端坐在火焰间的方寸之地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的妇人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她坐在仅剩的椅子上，木然无声，火舌与她只有咫尺距离，却仿佛被一道无形的墙隔绝开来。\n她周身纤尘不染，连头发也一丝不乱。她双眼微闭，又仿佛看着一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至此，我洁净了他们的灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
